<title>USA: USDA authorizes PL-480 rice purchase for Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>USDA authorizes PL-480 rice purchase for Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Department of Agriculture issued an authorization Thursday for purchases of $10 million worth of rice under Title I of the PL-480 program.</p>
<p>The authorization provides for about 27,000 tonnes of long-, medium- or short- grain milled rice, or brown rice for processing, grade U.S. No. 5 or better, USDA said.</p>
<p>Contracting is September 26-30 and delivery is October 17 through December 31.</p>
<p>-- Washington Commodities Desk (202) 898-8489</p>
</text>
